  "lineage": "Danish tradition of the vise, a strophic song in which the text leads, sung to guitar or piano in a clear, conversational voice. In the later twentieth century it was renewed in Copenhagen song clubs and on record by singers such as Povl Dissing and the poet-songwriter Benny Andersen, and it is cultivated by the Visens Venner societies.",
